  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-007 and 009 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, Xayah and Yone. Version 0.10.1 fixes Yone's compact portrait routing on scoreboard and side-list surfaces, removes duplicate attack-frame bodies, raises recall/idle foot anchors above the health bar, covers the full picked-card transition, and rebuilds W/R feedback with independent ImageGen effects. It retains the hit-gated two-stage Q, crowd-control-gated W pursuit, six-slash R with one final fixed-damage soul echo, official audio, all 13 native animation tags, frame rectangles and timings, plus the existing Rift quality pack and League-style UI/audio. Built for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
